ne-height: 30px; font-weight: 700; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid; margin-top: 40px;"&gt;超越简短&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;亚历山德拉·S·莱文 (Alexandra S. Levine) 在&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/cdUCQa-RWDCXuR6hCEuOJQ9jSZhyd8tm07EWVvpGSCqBidUKS7pVQ7sqP0L4r0FgY0lEsqFUtP0XADs5K4wsd0EFAmylMYltRe-6X9MpPhvHF2A6RpBt5jjTYSXCLSwv9sx9l2PK1gvetspK0_LVsqfGG59kEtjGfJNKy6eHjvkXG83SDVAW7r7Fk1FAx0bZnTmyRKVqtMStPY6lGtMVw2QDOftK8HBTa9L8Lp7VzZFrpciwIGvtaRlHriAZfJ9G9__LaU3f1tb5FyeIuJALNOXr12zaTGHyVTHqqzF8mIO-pYLP4VfmBLbDCy_VngRvDO6h1qKwX_tdIEdHa0NUeK5t_syi2zK_xfB7sZ2fUbl-dECslHvT8Ck36i025SvHt6yDZKBB4FiILsGapgejbAVUGA8jy029v_QOHXSwLbd3JztfoZkMofU-xp7fL80-Sy3ucYZjiIWxlRupWiEBJePIoJVzga6iWgOBnHe3/frCkXKNwLCxFzoHZIdkZjNKEkV1DLWoO/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="Nvidia 试图推动人工智能未来的繁荣"&gt;今天的《Tech In Depth》&lt;/a&gt;中写道，GLP-1 减肥药的促销活动充斥着社交媒体，并且轰炸了青少年的生活节奏。她写道，这些药物对年轻人健康的不良影响可能会引发下一波针对社交媒体公司的诉讼。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt; &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/brkMhs3-0CG3Sj7zqBdWT7u47ZvFE9iv8dmVF2huM5dFQtdz3TeDIU4PnUCpH6OxYioZi2bTVQnkGPPeLoRl8kHl33C9kn4ctCZJvxFSn8XQBu64p7G_U9zy-ASsi_Y3bX_GinFP07qvObp6lo5PvLvAR_C_ygT2v9YI1JSF_4R2A-yHUClCDDbxgqcJ9c9wDBjeaatp0q6X0B-AGXits5UA0ooJDwAnvnDZDGu1Ljv1soDmNA1RFMdKZUDcvJIGm5KptQHycgrda6leGfNbKl5rg3H29BcEpVmLe6wgdrY5UUd81kA8FM5kga7B829eQQiiuKEYn6ugBYM4tEvsx-x_eO8S7Px4dRj2SwcevqLcKLaJ0iKfSZGyjj2lYfDvlfbq2S_DME_0wqel3WJpS8fV8fLERJDydXz_kzgVBOttJY0ijivKcL9jGrRKM_d3ueOM1u7CAXpchiLub4uUb2vyKvRwgI8n2lMgQFMgOQ/yLGESR4Wv2iNTI18wClGEMG_EmPy4AUI/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="技术深度"&gt;&lt;em style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;获取《Tech In Depth》时事通讯&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;，了解彭博社世界各地记者对技术业务的分析和独家报道。&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 30px; font-weight: 700; padding-top: 12px; border-to