"font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.4; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;但 2026 年世界上规模最大的&lt;/strong&gt;总统选举还远未尘埃落定。尽管博尔索纳罗的竞选活动一片混乱，但在上周公布的民意调查中， &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/1-edTtRLrYlQNwbzVS7tgRLRdekKzMdOuDPZb3wPfi8lPbLjelZnCafiCZIO57pIqDEEsYtJGwd-wauK2UZiq1yaduiw0b_FumBYOaohYgeMeVnnyGmmg8fr3-ZFUCn0GpXNs0s2USd_QjXPiwb6D295EjIoXVN17tnvn2jOzGRYOItu-2nZBNAul77Q6L8g1SsRixs3NXKDyMaZ3Kmw6PfEm2a6WAO22nw8R7EKZgCV9mcu8EtR5GTbzth1IDIZrELzXjJ9amHMmHI1_EhEOemZrPFsvPdIKfb3tFbLjySFGlcCNRNlER5vU03tKKtr7sKwHLLVHjEibqotVfo2anqHyKTlMh6vuGk17BbLMw1KECdjmNY0xB-nLja48tERSDDWzCEk3IU2lQSsduacZMJyjcOBnO4xDirn6tlmeJcQ2gT_F4hlZ8x7u1OTrX7eAI6CxqRawEFsanDBK4hFIA8-ZGsafXXVhdBRgdaC6x5mCNm-ZytSE9HN3kdGwKqdx4-Tn0E0Fy5xL0Y-D63SWlYmr5KBO4y8SdTmCiZXzf-R_Nv1/n3rk9iCFo2EK65Pg8-DqWA49sWh712jw/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: #00e; font-size: 16px;" target="_blank" title="巴西选举民意调查中卢拉对博尔索纳罗的领先优势缩小"&gt;他仅落后三个百分点&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.4; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;这提醒人们，选民的&lt;/strong&gt;愤怒助长了&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/3LwtNLEO_DehYbw1K1lFrqxZAP8rwnYSUFOMRLiAJyzSJuX7XxcY9LBxTeZj6Ff9DZ-OE3EZZuRYUtM9IIg2S0geK3TZfVN73whDhSOeB6ybvEKiMk1oULOPdzxt4HXJFZrci700e_ilAS-HQSpD9rXMdTmObZ-phs37g7tUsRn_6WQ5uqDFkOPm8Uhb_0lzq71pw6ppxQ9_WoQm92dGVVEMzKwnFj72wq_PaM-3kJ4xIMvPlV3fdbSbaeBlte1yg5SFPRw5FoaDDrS6m9br1RyLJx9MgUP7XPJwjz7-makwGROKiN9h6zBwYogy3sGTFm70kg1QVzOnEYhV-dLAOUzuqqdTTIh738d4OcHRNWQ9XVNZzMIPgCDizDxP6vvp30sl9HNFheE7eDsguLaYuM0LaFVo2K-7Db5rJcJxwbICym6N5jQlwsynyY8SjEptLpCgLIoWl4LQW8uQiSYpDIpKEDBC8oM1ghMsNZgh6MF6eaf_-mNTDOO9LEuFAwv7QcSYMpQ87cDuajz6QOHq-KsueSC4uKwgF5i5Xi338StssXiaH2-q/rbNm66RLQGmZFRj8G6hMRRxX9V_YKgje/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: #00e; font-size: 16px;" target="_blank" title="全球选民的愤怒迎来了“威权民粹主义”时代"&gt;全球反现任情绪浪潮，但&lt;/a&gt;在 10 月份的投票中，巴西仍可能遭受高度两极分化的打击。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="font-style